      <a href="/books" style="color: white; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 20px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 4px; transition: background-color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#555'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent'">書籍一覧</a>
